# The image is built from the repository root, but only the server and the shared logic it uses go in.
# Everything is excluded first, then the needed parts are let back in. Secrets, backups and the rest never reach the image.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!api/package.json
!api/src
!db/package.json
!db/src
!db/drizzle
!vendor/oracle/shared/core/package.json
!vendor/oracle/shared/core/src
